      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPEEDY ZIPPER (7) boasts a strong record this journey with five wins and three minors from 11 tries. Placed last time (35.04) at Gosford in a Grade 5, finishing third and beaten 2 lengths. Makes strong appeal on best. MR. NICKO (1) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by a nose at this track in a handy 32.10. Nicely placed here on the inside and has a good record over this journey. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Expected to feature again. FLAT OUT FREDDY (4) is having his first start around this track. In the money last start when second (29.81) at Gosford over 515m. Has never missed the frame from four starts from this draw, including two wins. Must be included in calculations. BACKYARD FRIENDS (8) has ability and can feature with the right run after missing a cheque here most recently.",
